### Create an item (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Interview starter"}

> {% client.global.set("itemId", response.body.id); %}

### Read the item created above
GET http://localhost:8081/api/items/{{itemId}}

### Validation example (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": ""}

### Missing item (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
